# Amazon Managed Streaming for Apache Kafka Developer Guide

> Developer guide for Amazon Managed Streaming for Apache Kafka.

- [Welcome](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/msk/latest/developerguide/what-is-msk.md)
- [Setting up](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/msk/latest/developerguide/before-you-begin.md)
- [Quota](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/msk/latest/developerguide/limits.md)
