- [Prevent cross-service confused deputy problem](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/msk/latest/developerguide/cross-service-confused-deputy-prevention.md): The confused deputy problem is a security issue where an entity that doesn't have permission to perform an action can coerce a more-privileged entity to perform the action.
- [AWS managed policies](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/msk/latest/developerguide/mkc-security-iam-awsmanpol.md): Learn about AWS managed policies for MSK Connect and recent changes to those policies.
