- [Set up a NAT gateway](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/msk/latest/developerguide/msk-connect-internet-access-private-subnets-example.md): The following steps show you how to set up a NAT gateway to enable internet access for a connector.

### [Understand private DNS hostnames](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/msk/latest/developerguide/msk-connect-dns.md)

Describes Private DNS hostname resolution feature in MSK Connect.

- [Configure a VPC DHCP option](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/msk/latest/developerguide/msk-connect-dns-config-dhcp.md): Describes the configuration requirements for publicly and privately resolvable DNS hostnames.
