- [Data freshness higher than configured](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/msk/latest/developerguide/msk-data-delivery-s3-ts-freshness.md)
- [Throughput exceeds the supported limit](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/msk/latest/developerguide/msk-data-delivery-s3-ts-throughput.md)
